description: Configuration, environment variables, and secrets handling
---
### Configuration and Secrets

- Default config lives in [config/config.yaml](mdc:config/config.yaml). Do not commit secrets.
- Load configuration via `spatial_fabric_sdk/config.py` helpers when available.
- Prefer environment variables for sensitive overrides; do not hardcode credentials.
- For Handle auth, respect `handle.authentication` block if enabled.
- Keep `.whl` paths and local SDK artifacts out of rules-based logic; document install in README.
